# USB-root boot support for PocketCHIP.
#
# Debian's MODULES=most includes the generic EHCI/OHCI platform drivers here,
# but not all of the Allwinner USB PHY, USB storage, and SCSI disk modules.
# Keep these explicit so root=LABEL=pocketroot can appear from initramfs.
i2c-mv64xxx
axp20x-regulator
axp20x_usb_power
axp20x_ac_power
axp20x_battery
axp20x_adc
pinctrl-axp209
phy-sun4i-usb
ehci-platform
ohci-platform
usb-storage
uas
scsi_common
scsi_mod
sd_mod
ext4
